Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}《红圈会》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.10,0:02:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红圈会奇案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strange case of the Red Circle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开始于纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}started in New York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终结于澳大利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ended in the Antipodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但首先还是让我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first I should explain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两个名字都以G开头的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how two men with the initial G{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是怎么到伦敦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came to be in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗是个好汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro was the hero,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑乔治阿诺却是个恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Gorgiano, the villain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他俩都爱上了艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and both men loved Emilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么可以帮…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, what can I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有房间出租？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a room to let?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你瞧 我没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you see I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁呀 阿尔伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it, Albert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我妻子 平常都是她来掌管这些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wife, she usually sees to this, you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 是个访客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A visitor my dear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想租个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wanting a room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 阿尔伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Albert,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回你的"造船室"吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go into your boat building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你需要什么 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, sir, what do you require?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是只过一个晚上呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a room for the night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是长住？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or for a longer stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说吧 渥伦太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Mrs. Warren,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看不出有什么特别的理由 让你觉得不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot think you have any particular reason for uneasiness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也注意到了我还有其他事要忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you note I have other things to engage me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 一个房客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, the matter of a lodger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他的房间里待上一个星期也不露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remaining unseen in his room for more than a week{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难免引人好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is surely of some passing interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换了是我 房东几个星期也不会看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were a lodger she wouldn't see me for weeks on end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这没有让你不安吧 哈德森太太？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't trouble you, does it Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没什么不安的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing troubles me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.51,0:05:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要是有你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you're concerned, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你还记得么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一年前 你就接过渥伦太太的 一个房客的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you arranged an affair for a lodger of Mrs. Warren's a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 你接过 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you did, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个意大利绅士 费尔马尼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an Italian gentleman, Mr. Firmani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩瑞克 费尔马尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enrico Firmani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费尔马尼先生不厌其烦地 说着你的好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Firmani never stopped talking of your kindness, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么样打破黑暗带来光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you brought light into the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是个瓦格纳之夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a Wagner night I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们听听这个房客的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us hear about this lodger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它吓着我了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It frightens me, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吓的我没法睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't sleep for fright{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听着他的脚步声从这到那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hearing his footsteps moving here and moving there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从早到晚一刻不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from early morning to late at night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却从来见不到他 哪怕是一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I never, never catch so much as a glimpse of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渥伦先生也像我一样紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Warren is as nervous as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那家伙在逃避什么呢 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the fellow hiding from, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干过什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has he done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道除了那个女仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see except for the maid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家里就剩下她跟那个房客了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's all alone in the house with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我受不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't stand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的神经承受不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, nerves can't stand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 看看怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, cope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 拿嗅盐来 要是你有的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smelling salts, Mrs. Hudson, if you have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仔细想想 渥伦太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take time to consider, Mrs. Warren,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最微小的事也可能是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the smallest point may be the most essential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是10天前来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came 10 days ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他向我房租\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he asked me my terms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就说一星期12先令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I told him 12 shillings a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一间小的起居室和卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a small sitting room and a bedroom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}位于顶楼 里面一切齐备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all complete all at the top of the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说愿意付一星期3镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he said he'd pay me three pounds a week for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}3镑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生 一星期3镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, three pounds a week{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是得遵守他的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as I kept his terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么条件？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 他想要一把房屋的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he wanted a key to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这没什么 大多数房客都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all right most of my lodgers have them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他要求完全一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he was to be left entirely to himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}决不能被打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and never on any account to be disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也没什么奇怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's nothing very wonderful about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}算不上个理由 可这又是根本没有道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not in reason but this is out of all reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他住进来有10天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been in there 10 days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管是早晨 中午还是晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}morning, noon and night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不论是她 还是渥伦先生或女仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and neither she nor Mr. Warren{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都没有看过他 哪怕就一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor the maid has once set eyes on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了刚来的那个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And apart from the first night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也从来没有出去过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's never once gone out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 刚来的晚上他出去过么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he did go out on the first night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 出去过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, he did,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他很晚才回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he returned very late,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd gone to bed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是渥伦先生看到他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Mr. Warren saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他回来时已经过了午夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was after midnight he'd come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那吃饭怎么办 我肯定他得吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These meals, I mean surely he eats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他要吃饭时就摇铃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well he rings when he wants them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们把饭放在他门口的椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We put them on a chair outside his door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他还需要些什么的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he wants anything else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就写在一小片纸上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he writes it on a bit of paper,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用铅笔写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this just in pencil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有只言片语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just the one word nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早饭时女仆把"每日新闻"报带给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The maid leaves the Daily Chronicle with him every morning at breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么用印刷体来写？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it printed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了隐瞒他的笔迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to conceal his handwriting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你有什么推论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, deduce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}铅笔尖很宽 写起来带点紫色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the pencil is broad tipped and violet tinted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写的时候… 写的时候相当用力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's used with, well it's used with considerable pressure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没写完纸就被划破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the paper's been torn off at the side before the printing was done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能看到“肥皂”的这个S没写完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can see the S of soap is partly gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表明什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suggesting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}匆忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者是谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说说这个男人的年龄和长相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's age and appearance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不到30 先生 一身黑衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's under 30, sir, he's very dark,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}中等身材 胡子刮得很干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}middle height, clean-shaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说话的口音和费尔马尼先生很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, has an accent like Mr. Firmani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 他没有名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course no name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有信件或者访客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No letters or callers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个都没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的行李呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His luggage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面有没有签条？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Labels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者贴纸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stickers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"白色之星"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十天前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从纽约来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们还是等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that we must wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到有更多的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we have a little more material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}二位请便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please vanish both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 谢谢你 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}交给我吧 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it to me, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得承认 福尔摩斯 这事还是有点意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must admit, Holmes, there are some points of interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一点 房间里的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only that the man in the rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能和订房间的人不是同一个人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may not be the one who engaged them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对啊 当然 我怎么没有想到这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course, I hadn't thought of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在订了房间后他立刻就走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he went out immediately after taking the rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到午夜才回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and returned at midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么要换人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why a substitution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}值得为此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, opens up a pleasurable feel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}展开一番推理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for intelligent speculation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一条调查的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there is one line of investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渥伦太太的前房客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Warren's former lodger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不勒斯的恩瑞克 费尔马尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enrico Firmani of Naples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在皇家歌剧院的后台工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He works backstage at the Royal Opera House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾帮他找到过失散的至亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped him find a close relative once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很简单的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A simple matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡奇普尔街37号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}37 Catchpole Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你补充了些东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You added something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对那些需要帮助的同乡来说 他是一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend to his fellow countrymen in need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不是认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他向他需要帮助的同乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he could've recommended his former lodgings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}推荐了他的前房东？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a fellow countryman in need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这解释不了房客的举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it doesn't explain the lodge's behavior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}举动？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behavior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么举动？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What behavior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么知道这儿的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know this address?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从福尔摩斯先生那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他总是保留着他过去委托人的相关记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always keeps a record of his past clients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是福尔摩斯要问我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if Holmes has something to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他不亲自来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why does he not come himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么派你来 华生医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why send you, Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我偶尔也自己行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I do on occasion act for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕我帮不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I cannot help you I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对渥伦太太的这个房客一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know nothing of this lodger of Mrs. Warren's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是不是你的一个同乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he perhaps a fellow countryman of yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刚从美国来 需要帮助？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recently arrived from America in need of help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你告诉福尔摩斯我就在这里 如果他需要我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then tell him I'm here if he needs me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能说这么多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is all I can say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我得去工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must go to work now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能是渥伦太太需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be that Mrs. Warren needs help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个男人在打扰她的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man is disturbing her household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么 他做了什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, what does he do to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子更主要是关于他没有做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's more a case of what he doesn't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他从早到晚从不露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't appear from dawn till dusk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的饮食留在门外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has his meals on a tray left outside the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他是一个亡命之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's a fugitive from justice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们应该把他交给警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we should turn him over to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caio Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果有什么问题的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is a problem,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯知道在哪里找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes knows where to find me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在剧院 别来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the theatre not here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别再来这里了 医生 你听明白了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never here Doctor, do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这行当 你树了不少敌人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have enemies in your line of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个人都有敌人 不管他们是干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has enemies whatever they do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真实的生活就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that not true of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但有些人冒的风险更高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But some are more at risk than others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于他们的信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with their beliefs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他们的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.89,0:13:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做我该做的 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do what I do, Doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别要求我做一个圣徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't make me out to be a saint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在请容我失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now please excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赞巴先生 是纽约的主要水果出口公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signor Zamba, senior partner in the firm of Castallote and Zamba,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡斯特罗 & 赞巴公司的高级合伙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}chief fruit importers of New York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最近在他家公寓前的台阶上被刺杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was stabbed repeatedly on the steps of his mansion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事发生在8周之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this is dated eight weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}平克顿侦探事务所的侦探里默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detective Rimmer of the Pinkerton Agency,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾贝 里默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe Rimmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在犯罪现场表示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said at the scene of the slaying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事是那不勒斯的帮会所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we believe this is the work of a Neapolitan society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其与烧炭党联合后 以红圈会闻名于世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allied to the old Carbonari known as the Red Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全欧洲都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Famous throughout Europe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在在布鲁克林也发展了一个分支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a branch is now being planted in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侦探们地怀疑一个叫朱塞佩 乔治阿诺的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detectives are anxious to question a Giuseppe Gorgiano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费尔马尼可能还隐瞒了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Firmani was hiding something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说不出来这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't describe the feeling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那还有一个老妇人 我推测是他的母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there was an old woman who I took to be his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的母亲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去他的家里了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You went to his home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.55,0:14:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那张写满悲伤和秘密的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A face full of sorrow and secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你帮助的就是这个人么 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the person that you helped, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你对我隐瞒了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're holding something back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你能告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should like you to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去他的家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By going to his home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能会给费尔马尼带来死亡的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may have put Firmani's life in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为那些在伦敦的意大利人提供庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a point of refuge for the Italian community in London,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像是灯塔发出来的光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a beacon of light if you will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这张罪恶的黑网中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a dark web of devilry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红圈会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Red Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这个乔治阿诺么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this Gorgiano?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑乔治阿诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Gorgiano,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有死神之称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's earned the name of death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在南意大利和更远地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}La Morte in Southern Italy and far beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是很有名的杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's red up to the elbows in murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有可能这个黑乔治阿诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it possible that this Black Gorgiano{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是渥伦太太的房客？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the man at Mr. Warren's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的 但有着某种联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but there may be some connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我们有事要做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, we have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去歌剧院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The opera house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.69,0:15:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后在查令街十字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Charing Cross{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我的朋友艾贝 里默发一封电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to send a telegram to my friend Abe Rimmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常好 莱文小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful, Miss. Laven,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请再来一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just once more, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩瑞克 费尔马尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enrico Firmani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直和我作对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been troublesome to me for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now you help me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就饶你一条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in return for your life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗 卢卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro Lucca,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把他藏到哪去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where are you hiding him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底说还是不说 恩瑞克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you tell me, Enrico?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里不容许通行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's allowed in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍金斯 你怎么到这来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins, what brings you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想和你来的理由一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing that brings you I expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法想象您这么快就接手这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you got onto it so fast I can't imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不同的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Different threads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我们引到了同一场纷争里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leading up to the same tangle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是来找恩瑞克 费尔马尼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've come to see Enrico Firmani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Firmani's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在还不到2小时前 在这里被人割断了喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was found with his throat cut less than two hours ago up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕凶手已经逃得无影无踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer got clean away I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说中了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right, Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今早不该去找他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should not have gone this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许能救他一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might have saved a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这不该怪罪于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you can blame yourself for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才子娇娃同归泉壤 正像扫烟囱人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Golden boys and girls all must as chimneysweeps come to dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个人孤身来到伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A person arrives alone in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他去找费尔马尼寻求帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seeks help from Firmani,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的同乡为了安全起见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his fellow countryman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安排他住在渥伦太太的公寓里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who places him for safety in Mrs. Warren's lodgings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}紧接着费尔马尼被谋杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Firmani is murdered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为不肯说出这个藏身之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rather than give away the hiding place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不能肯定这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of that we can't be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是谁杀了他呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who killed him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔治阿诺？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gorgiano?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔治阿诺在英国么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Gorgiano in England?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想把这个房客怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does he want with this lodger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公寓房间里的那个人 完全孤立 很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The person in that room is entirely alone and at risk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至写一封信都可能被截获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean even a letter might be intercepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么他是怎么收到外面的消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does a message reach him from the outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非是通过那个最有价值的猎场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except by that most valuable hunting ground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至对那些不同寻常的学者来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever given to the student of the unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报上的广告栏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agony columns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只需要把注意力放在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need only concern ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去两周的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Daily Chronicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每日新闻报上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the past two weeks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的房客每天早饭后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which our lodger collects every morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都要翻阅它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after his breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好一个喊叫和呻吟的大合唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what a chorus of cries and groans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好一堆怪事奇闻的大杂烩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a ragbag of singular happenings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在王子滑冰俱乐部…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady with a feather boa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戴黑色羽毛围巾的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Prince's Skating Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 听听这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, listen to this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耐心点 将寻找一种可靠的通信方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be patient, will find some means of communications,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前仍用此栏 G\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}meanwhile this column G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能再沿着这条线索找下去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you pick up a trace again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正在做有效安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm making successful arrangements,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请耐心谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}patience and prudence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乌云就会散去 G\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the clouds will pass G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 没有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这 道路已清除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, here, the path is clearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如有机会 当发信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I find chance to signal message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记住说定的暗号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remember code as agreed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是两天前的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么事 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我正洗窗帘呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm washing curtains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请找一下昨天和今天的每日新闻报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Daily Chronicle yesterday and today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你乐意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you'd be so kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耐心谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience and prudence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在这事终于有点眉目了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the affair begins to grow more intelligible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带门廊和黑门的房子 第二层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}House with porch and black door, first floor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户右边 黄昏后 G\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}window right, after dusk, G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.37,0:21:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}G… 黑乔治阿诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}G, Black Gorgiano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能会是个陷阱 来引那个人出去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could it be a trap, to draw the person out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.87,0:21:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不大可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.93,0:21:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是不是该把已经知道的 红圈会的事告诉警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well should we not tell the police what we know about the Red Circle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉警察？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the police,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们手头的事就够他们受的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they find it difficult enough to deal with the facts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别用我们的想法来让他们更困惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without confusing them with our suppositions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听听这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, listen to this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无动机的谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}motiveless murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据对霍金斯警督的采访 真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to Inspector Hawkins, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:21:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 医生 你最好快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, Doctor, you must come quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人被绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's been a kidnapping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.85,0:22:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该交给警察 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a police matter, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要把那个房客赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm throwing that lodger out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该去和他直说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have gone straight up and told him so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她认为应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she thought it only right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先征求您的意见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ask your opinion first, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请泡一壶茶 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A large pot of tea please, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我实在是没有耐心了 这已经连累到我丈夫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm at the end of my patience when it comes to knocking my old man about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁要伤害他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knocked him about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要是知道就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I knew that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情是今早发生的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happened this morning, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渥伦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Warren{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是托特纳姆宫廷路上 诺顿 & 美易达公司的计时员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's a timekeeper at Norton & Waylight's on Tottenham Court Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他必须在早晨七点钟以前出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has to leave the house before seven in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.69,0:22:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我能和他谈谈会大有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would greatly help me if I could speak to him myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.88,0:22:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.69,0:22:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小心点 福尔摩斯 他心脏不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, Holmes, his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来说说吧 渥伦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you speak, Mr. Warren?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.38,0:22:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我出门还没有走上10步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hadn't gone ten paces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.82,0:22:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后面就来了两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before two men crept up behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.33,0:23:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿大衣蒙住了他的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And threw a coat over his head,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.03,0:23:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他塞到了马车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bundled him into cab{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.69,0:23:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开了一段路后 在汉普斯特德荒地把他扔了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drove off and shot him out on Hampstead Heath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}汉普斯特德荒地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hampstead Heath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真可怕 你看到什么了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dreadful, what did you observe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我乘公共汽车回的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took a bus home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这之前呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the bus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.47,0:23:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.12,0:23:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有看清他们的长相？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you observe their appearance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 先生 好像是变魔术一样 我被抓进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, I was picked up as if by magic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又被扔出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dropped as if by magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}车里至少有3个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three of them at least was in on it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.47,0:23:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也可能是4个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听见他们说话了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear them talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.34,0:23:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中一个用意大利语赌咒发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them swore some oaths in Italian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钱可不是万能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money is not everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.51,0:23:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今天就要把他给赶出去 就在今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have him out of here before the day is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见见你的这个房客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should like to meet this lodger of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他什么时候吃午饭？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time does he take his lunch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.90,0:23:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One o'clock sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有什么地方能让我们藏起来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anywhere where we might conceal ourselves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:24:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有的 楼上有个储藏室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, there's a box room upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.69,0:24:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有一面大镜子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a looking glass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有的 在房间外楼梯平台那的抽屉里有一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, there's one on the chest of drawers outside on the landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了 来吧 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent, come, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有40分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got forty minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.39,0:24:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很明显他的敌人们弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's clear now that his enemies mistook their man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.75,0:24:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想都不敢想 要是他们抓到他会怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they would've done if they'd got him bears no thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.66,0:24:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可他们没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看到了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see what I see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.78,0:24:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个带门廊和黑门的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A house with a porch and black door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.36,0:24:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个房间出租\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a room to let{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.37,0:24:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样G就可以进到那里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to which G could have access.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.65,0:24:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我觉得我们应该通知苏格兰场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, I feel very strongly that we should inform Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.20,0:24:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.58,0:24:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are on watch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.64,0:25:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许也在被监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and may be being watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.30,0:25:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们看看房子后面有什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what lies behind these lodgings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.21,0:25:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他感觉怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's he feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.53,0:25:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 他很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.45,0:25:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就是喜欢小题大做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just likes a fuss made of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.97,0:27:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.68,0:27:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}锁上你的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bolt your door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.90,0:27:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们回来前别让任何人进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let no one in until we return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.95,0:27:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看到他了么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.41,0:27:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渥伦太太 请相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Warren, trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道他什么时候回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know when he's coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.01,0:27:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他给了我一些钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave me some money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.23,0:27:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后就再没有见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I haven't seen him since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.69,0:27:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说是一个外国绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A foreign gentlemen, you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.11,0:27:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定是 但我不介意他是外国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely and I don't care for foreigners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.09,0:27:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.48,0:27:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你想租的话 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you want it gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.06,0:27:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以签个合同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure we can come to an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.81,0:27:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等你看完了以后 我在大厅等你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be in the hall sir, when you've finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.37,0:27:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.21,0:27:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公寓2楼的窗户里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the first floor window of the lodgings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.78,0:28:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住着我们焦虑的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our agitated lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.56,0:28:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需要再等几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a few more hours to wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.61,0:28:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会发信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黄昏之后 G\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After dusk, G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都符合为爱私奔的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has all the makings of some love escapade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱或许是这件事的根源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love may be at the root of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.26,0:28:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but her face,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.56,0:28:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生 她的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}oh, Watson her face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面写满了对生活的忧虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She fears for her life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.29,0:28:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想有一对夫妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consider a couple,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.77,0:28:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来伦敦避难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seek refuge in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.05,0:28:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了躲避某种威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from some instant and terrible fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.98,0:28:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丈夫为了最大限度保证妻子的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man desires her utmost safety{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.55,0:28:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而采用如此原始的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and arranges to communicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.72,0:28:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来进行联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in such original fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至是女房东 也不知道房客已经换人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for not even the landlady knows of the substitution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}字条是用印刷体写的 以防有人通过笔迹认出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's printed messages to prevent the fact that she's a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.71,0:29:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房客是一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being revealed by her handwriting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.63,0:29:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蜡烛和火柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A candle and matches,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.45,0:29:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.09,0:29:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在其实没这个必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's no need for this now surely,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.93,0:29:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就不能直接让他们见面么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can't we just simply bring them together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.24,0:29:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能保证我们能一直保护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guarantee that we'd protect them forever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}免遭红圈会的毒手么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the Red Circle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.96,0:29:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.57,0:29:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得让他们继续这么下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must let them play this thing out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.75,0:29:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我先回贝克街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must return briefly to Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.47,0:29:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能不能找个借口留在公寓？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have reason enough to stay in the lodgings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.96,0:29:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就说是为了渥伦先生的健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Warren's health gives me every excuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.14,0:29:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许我有必要把你的左轮手枪带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be advisable for me to bring back your revolver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.78,0:29:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用 我已经带着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No need to man, I have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.59,0:29:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.95,0:29:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一小时后见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you within the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:30:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍金斯 希望到头来有情人终相聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins, journey's end with lover's meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.47,0:30:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会主持正义的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do you this justice, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我办案子的时候只要是跟您合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was never in a case yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.77,0:30:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就没有一次觉的不踏实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't feel stronger for having you on my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}逃亡的人可能是杰内罗和艾米莉亚 卢卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fugitives may be Gennaro and Emilia Lucca{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.89,0:30:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果是这样 那他们处境危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if so in grave danger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.97,0:30:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很需要我们协助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}expect agent imminently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝好 署名艾贝 里默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regards, Abe Rimmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已经来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agent's here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.18,0:30:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天早晨从纽约来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he arrived from New York this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.06,0:30:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}名字叫莱弗顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Leverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.86,0:30:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说过这个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leverton I know of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.03,0:30:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一直在追捕黑乔治阿诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man he's after is Black Gorgiano,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.33,0:30:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红圈会的头目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leader of the Red Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.54,0:30:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是不是这一次领先你了 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we score over you for once, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.08,0:30:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得更努力一点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must give us best some of the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.67,0:30:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们都应该竭尽全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that we should pool our resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's someone up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.63,0:31:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渥伦太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs Warren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.82,0:31:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让楼下保持安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the peace downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.54,0:31:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得和卢卡夫人说几句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have a word with Senora Lucca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.66,0:31:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卢卡夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senora Lucca,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.43,0:31:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是歇洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}its Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must speak to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.33,0:31:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:32:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你丈夫杰内罗和你都会安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your husband Gennaro, will be safe, and so will you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你愿意接受我们的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you will place yourself in our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.13,0:32:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苏格兰场在监视这所房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotland Yard is watching the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.37,0:32:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱弗顿先生也在从纽约赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mr. Leverton is on his way from New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.03,0:32:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱弗顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Leverton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.66,0:32:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不会让你受到任何伤害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall not let any harm come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.93,0:32:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请让我进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please let me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.93,0:32:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.33,0:32:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我再也不上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going up there again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.63,0:32:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.64,0:32:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 别说傻话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh don't be silly dear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.53,0:32:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't be silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.23,0:32:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听到医生的话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the doctor said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.92,0:32:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一只猫在抓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was just a cat scratching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.31,0:32:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不是的 天花板都被掀起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't, it lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.82,0:32:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 你能给维拉倒杯茶么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson, would you make Vera a cup of tea, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.85,0:32:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这屋子里发生什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on in this house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.97,0:33:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吵吵嚷嚷 灯也不亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noises, lights going off,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.27,0:33:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我快要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll be the death of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.95,0:33:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.90,0:33:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我出生在那不勒斯附近的波西利波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born in Posillipo near Naples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲是名首席律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was chief lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.41,0:33:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗没有钱 也没有地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro had no money and no position,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.48,0:33:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然没有这些 但是他英俊 有活力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing but his beauty, his strength and energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.91,0:33:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲不同意我们结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father forbade the match{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.62,0:33:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就私奔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we run away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.04,0:33:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在巴里结了婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were married in Bari.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.93,0:33:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我卖掉了首饰当路费 来到了美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sold my jewels to bring us to America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.18,0:33:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一开始命运向我们微笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortune smiled at first,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.82,0:33:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗从几个暴徒手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro saved a rich Italian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.53,0:33:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救下了一个富有的意大利人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from some ruffians in the Bowery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.38,0:33:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是卡斯特罗先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was Signor Castallote{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.28,0:33:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经营卡斯特罗&赞巴水果出口公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Castallote and Zamba the fruit importers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.28,0:33:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗与他情同父子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro became like a son to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.16,0:34:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我们这个访客的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about this visitor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.82,0:34:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个你们从波西利波来的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this friend of your husbands from Posillipo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.81,0:34:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 他不是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is no friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.94,0:34:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗有一天把他带回家来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro brought him home one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.37,0:34:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是在街上偶遇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had met in the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.18,0:34:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以后他就经常来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came again and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.17,0:34:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他大谈什么政治和社会问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He talked and raved about politics and social questions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.98,0:34:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及他的打算 还挥舞着他巨大的手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what he meant to do, whirling his great arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.88,0:34:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的声音在我们的小房子里 听起来就像是打雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His voice was like thunder in our little house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你的丈夫呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.76,0:34:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他坐在那 脸色苍白 无精打采\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sat pale and listless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一开始我以为他是不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first I thought it was dislike{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.95,0:34:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来我才明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then I understood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.15,0:34:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一种深藏的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was a deep secret fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.40,0:34:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求他出于对我的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I implored him out of love for me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.42,0:34:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于我们相濡以沫的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by all we held dear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.27,0:34:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我为什么这个人 能给他带来这么大的阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tell me why this man overshadowed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.09,0:35:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他年少不羁的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In his wild, young days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.86,0:35:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全世界好像都跟他过不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when all the world seemed against him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.14,0:35:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就加入了一个兄弟会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had joined a brotherhood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.43,0:35:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃尔 奇卡罗索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}El Chicaroso{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.33,0:35:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红圈会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Red Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.04,0:35:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他以为它的目的仅仅是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thought its purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.55,0:35:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反对生活中的不公正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was to put right the injustice of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.33,0:35:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦你发了那个可怕的誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you've taken its dreadful oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.05,0:35:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我关于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.41,0:35:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和乔治阿诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Gorgiano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.86,0:35:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就注意到了 当他来找我们时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had noticed for some time when he came to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.90,0:35:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他总是盯着我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his eyes were always turned upon me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.34,0:35:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那眼睛真可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his terrible glaring eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.68,0:35:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一天晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one evening,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.23,0:35:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说我唤醒了他所谓的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had awakened what he called love in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.16,0:36:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 艾米莉亚 我的唯一 - 那是一种野兽般的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emilia, mio solo grande. - It was the love of a brut,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}野蛮粗俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几天以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few days later,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.49,0:36:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红圈会有一个会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was a Red Circle meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.50,0:36:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们勒索卡斯特罗先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signor Castallote had been approached for money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却遭到了拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and had refused them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.56,0:36:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是他们计划杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they planned to kill him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.44,0:36:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过抽签来决定谁动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they drew lots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.73,0:36:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是早就安排好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.20,0:36:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我拒绝了乔治阿诺 他要报复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Gorgiano's revenge for my rejecting him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.68,0:37:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在这世上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dearest friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.14,0:37:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in all the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.06,0:37:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后你们一起去了警察局？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you both went to the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.69,0:37:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一个人去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.07,0:37:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.12,0:37:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算是 可这有什么用呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but what has it done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.97,0:37:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们被迫逃走 我们的朋友还是难逃一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got us away but friends still die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.99,0:37:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们永远逃不出那野兽的控制 永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall never be rid of that beast, never{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.39,0:37:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now you must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.43,0:37:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经说的太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've said too much,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经违背了对我丈夫的许诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've broken my promise to my husband,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.86,0:37:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快走吧 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go please, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.01,0:38:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩瑞克会感到欣慰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enrico would have wished it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.01,0:38:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开始新的生活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go sail to a new life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.13,0:38:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.72,0:39:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不能整夜待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't stay here all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是有必要 他会的 是么 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well if he has to won't you, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.05,0:39:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 那样的话 我们来玩会惠斯特纸牌吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in that case I wouldn't mind a game of whist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.80,0:39:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你玩惠斯特纸牌么 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you play whist, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.89,0:40:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.92,0:40:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.26,0:40:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾米莉亚 我的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emilia, mi amore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.34,0:40:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.02,0:40:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经安排了人监视 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've set my men on watch, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.29,0:40:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在期待什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you expecting to happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.27,0:40:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不止一次 侦查行动的作用有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there are times when the art of detection is of little use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.84,0:40:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得等待那些无法预知的事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must wait upon the unpredictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.14,0:40:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也有这样的经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had some experience of that in my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.17,0:40:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以说 我们要等的是卢卡夫人的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can say only that we are expecting Signora Lucca's husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.19,0:40:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得放他过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must let him pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.65,0:41:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的人不要干扰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your men must not distract him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.35,0:41:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 他们知道的 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They know that. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.16,0:41:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那我们要抓的凶手呢？- 噢 他就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And our murderer? - Oh, he is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.00,0:41:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.09,0:41:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等待机会下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}waiting his chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.51,0:41:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}美国的莱弗顿给了我一份详尽的描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a good description from the American Leverton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.44,0:41:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.48,0:41:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.59,0:41:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.83,0:42:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卢卡夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signora Lucca,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.71,0:42:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须告诉我暗号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must give me the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.20,0:42:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开 我再不会相信你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away, I don't trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.94,0:42:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了我丈夫 我谁也不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust no one but my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.03,0:42:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢你 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm obliged to you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.28,0:42:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好不要动弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The main thing is just to keep this still as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.16,0:42:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 福尔摩斯先生 - 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Holmes. - Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.27,0:42:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是平克顿侦探事务所的 莱弗顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Leverton of the Pinkerton Agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.06,0:42:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}破获长岛山洞奇案的莱弗顿么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leverton, of the Long Island Cave mystery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.72,0:42:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很荣幸见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm honored to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.74,0:42:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我的荣幸 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The honor is mine, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.99,0:42:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.08,0:42:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可惜这幅模样见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry we had to meet like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.61,0:42:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a brave man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.59,0:42:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看到你在屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you on the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.33,0:42:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当你毕生时间都用来追踪这件事的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're on the trail of a lifetime, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.84,0:42:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也会把个人安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you put all thoughts of personal safety{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.00,0:42:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}置之度外的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.12,0:42:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想那混蛋跑掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brute got away I suppose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.00,0:42:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但他会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but he'll be back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.50,0:42:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这房子里有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something in this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.04,0:42:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他梦寐以求的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he wants badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.85,0:42:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.53,0:42:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 医生 我很好 真的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Doctor, I'm fine, just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.23,0:42:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上的女士安全么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the lady upstairs, safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但不再相信任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but trusting no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.77,0:43:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们必须等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so we must wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.19,0:43:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他丈夫发出的暗号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for her husband's signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.60,0:43:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么暗号 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What signal, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.74,0:43:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱弗顿 灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leverton, the lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.27,0:43:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说杰内罗 卢卡就在那儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Gennaro Lucca is over there now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.43,0:43:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没有 但我想他会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet but he will be I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.29,0:43:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我到伦敦的时候 我也找不到卢卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't find Lucca when I got to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们通过恩瑞克 费尔马尼进行联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My contact was Enrico Firmani{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.68,0:43:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那家伙找到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the brute reached him first{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.60,0:43:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在杀死他之前肯定也让他开口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he must have made him talk before killing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.97,0:43:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是不是该上楼去看看卢卡夫人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we not go upstairs to reassure Mrs. Lucca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.53,0:43:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不会让我们进到房间里去的 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't admit us, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.99,0:43:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她现在只听她丈夫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll only answer to her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.67,0:43:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 看哪 是霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, Hawkins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.19,0:43:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是很显眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not too conspicuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.31,0:43:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 霍金斯警督 他看来来很能干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Inspector Hawkins, he seems an able fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.79,0:43:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是苏格兰场最好的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of Scotland Yard's finest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.99,0:43:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}业务熟练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows his business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.71,0:44:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.14,0:44:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗 卢卡刚刚进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro Lucca has just gone in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.80,0:44:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前为止一切顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.96,0:44:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人是在红圈会计划要杀掉卡斯特罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Lucca came to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.46,0:44:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天晚上来找我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the night the Red Circle planned to kill Castallote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.63,0:44:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们已经杀掉了他的合伙人赞巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd already murdered his partner Zamba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.39,0:44:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们设法把团伙成员一网打尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We managed to round up most of the gang{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.27,0:44:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那个黑乔治阿诺漏网了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Black Gorgiano slipped the net.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.66,0:44:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一听说他来英国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we heard he'd left for England,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.30,0:44:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也就尽快赶来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed after him fast as I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.49,0:44:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和苏格兰场取得了联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got in touch with Scotland Yard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.66,0:44:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他却没有踪影了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he'd gone to ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.74,0:45:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开始发出暗号了 是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a single light, what does it mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.55,0:45:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两个灯光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.74,0:46:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 消失了 - 不 又有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gone. - No, no, there it is again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.90,0:46:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缓慢的闪三下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three lights measured slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.12,0:46:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他要说什么 到底什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he saying, what does it mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.87,0:46:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.81,0:46:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.28,0:46:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他下一步肯定是要确认一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his next actions must confirm it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.96,0:46:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定是来这里等她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must come here to collect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.13,0:46:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.12,0:46:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收到消息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The message received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.61,0:46:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.46,0:46:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.94,0:46:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dearest friend in all the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.51,0:46:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和兄弟会的叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and betrayer of the brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.54,0:47:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是在发信号 有个人跟他在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no message there's somebody with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.03,0:47:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.11,0:47:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听到了么 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.54,0:47:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.24,0:47:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 看 她跑出来了 跑到街上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, look she's out there on the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.10,0:47:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.83,0:47:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍金斯 你要抓的人在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins Your murderer is up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.03,0:47:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可能 这只有一个入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible, there's only one entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.16,0:47:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一下 他是我的人 霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute he's mine, Hawkins,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.72,0:47:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我来负责 - 不 你不能 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll take responsibility. - No you won't sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.22,0:47:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦的事由伦敦警方负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London dangers are up to the London force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.05,0:47:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰内罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gennaro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.94,0:48:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.19,0:48:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 带他们离开这个恐怖的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, take them away from this horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.19,0:48:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请把船票给我 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take those tickets, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.81,0:48:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求求你 我们的船黎明时起锚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, our ship sales at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.50,0:49:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算把它怎么办 警督？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do with him, Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.62,0:49:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将被逮捕 并以谋杀乔治阿诺的罪名被指控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be arrested and tried for the murder of Gorgiano,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.41,0:49:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法律就是法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.74,0:49:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道你们英国的法律会怎么对他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't know what your British law may be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.53,0:49:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我想要是在纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I guess that in New York,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.14,0:49:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位女士的丈夫会收到很多的感谢信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this lady's husband will receive a pretty general vote of thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.24,0:49:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这世上没有哪一个法官 会给这个男人判刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not a judge on earth that will condemn this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.50,0:49:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想卢卡夫妇没有什么好担心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Mr. And Mrs. Lucca have too much to fear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.82,0:49:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们还是得遵守法律程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we have to go through the procedures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.57,0:49:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带他们下楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.19,0:49:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你一个人在这里 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt if you'd been here on your own, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.14,0:49:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会有不同的解决方法吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd have found a different solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.51,0:49:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们生活在法律之下 警督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The law is what we live with, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.09,0:49:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但有的时候正义更难实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justice is sometimes harder to achieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.46,0:49:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还是不明白 你是怎么一开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I still don't understand is how you came to be mixed up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.70,0:50:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就卷到这件事里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in all this in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.97,0:50:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安警督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.22,0:50:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.54,0:50:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来英国的司法 对这对年轻夫妇很友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}English justice looked kindly on the young couple{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.63,0:50:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不久 他们就去了澳大利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and soon afterwards they left for Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.42,0:50:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里终于摆脱了红圈会的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they found a new and happier life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.90,0:50:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过着新的幸福生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}free from the threat of the Red Circle.{\r}
